usage:
For brand colors, labels and categories — anywhere the right answer is usually one of a few known colors. Free-form color fields invite off-brand chaos; the palette is the point. Listen for a new choice:

```js
document.addEventListener('kata-color-picker-change', event => {
  console.log(event.detail.value, event.detail.name);
});
```
The current hex value is also on the root as data-value.
